description.narrative:
The general objective is Saving lives of drought affected people and contributing towards rehabilitation of livelihoods in one district of Oromia region for three months. 
Specific objectives of the project are;
★	To enhance food security for 1,250 people’s (250HHs) through the provision of unconditional, multipurpose cash;
★	To improve the nutritional intake and health status of 150 malnourished children, 100 PLW, and 50 old persons through the provision of supplementary food aid;
★	To increase 5,350 people’s (1,070HHs) access to potable water through rehabilitation of three hands dug well water schemes, provision of water management and hygiene messaging; and
★	To enhance resilience capacity of 500 livestock (Cattle) to the current livestock disease outbreak through the provision of vet drugs
